=== cloister_1 ===
# title: Whispers in the Scriptorium
# order: 10
# activity: hermit scriptorium
The cloister is cold, and smells of ink and old candles.
brother_librarian: Mind the margins, child. The saints are watching. # right: brother_librarian
scion: (And so is that novice in the corner.)
novice: You copy well, for a girl. Do you ever read what you copy? # right: novice
scion: Should I not?
novice: Some books are kept from us for a reason. Ask me why, some day.
-> END
